OL,5,G0110 Room to Improve
OL,6,     FDermot teams up with Julian Benson
OL,7,     Fto convert an old Victorian house
OL,8,     Finto four self contained pods, for
OL,9,     Ffamilies of people with Cystic
OL,10,     FFibrosis.
OL,11,G0210 Build Your Own Home
OL,12,     FJoan and Andrea in Cavan intend to
OL,13,     Frenovate two adjoining family
OL,14,     Fstone cottages and build a timber
OL,15,     Fframe extension to the rear of the
OL,16,     Ftwo buildings for an office space.
